          "runs": [
            {
              "typeface": "roman",
              "text": "fagocumu."
            },
            {
              "typeface": "italic",
              "text": " Soſſentar, ou dar de comer a"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-l046",
          "indent": 1,
          "runs": [
            {
              "typeface": "italic",
              "text": "alguem."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "c1-l047",
          "runs": [
            {
              "typeface": "roman",
              "text": "Fagoita."
            },
            {
              "typeface": "italic",
              "text": " Taboinhas com que brincão os me-"
            }
          ],
          "note": "`Fagoita` is ハゴイタ, modern 羽子板. Its Portuguese definition continues in column 2; the item is the small board used in the New Year game."
        }
